{"product_id":"lifesaving-for-beginners","title":"Lifesaving for Beginners","description":"\u003cp\u003eKat Kavanagh is not in love. She has lots of friends, an ordinary job, and she never ever thinks about her past. This is Kat's story. None of it is true. Milo McIntyre loves his mam, the peanut-butter-and-banana muffins at the Funky Banana café, and the lifesaving class he does after school. He never thinks about his future, until the day it changes forever. This is Milo's story. All of it is true. And then there is the other story. The one with a twist of fate which somehow brings together a boy from Brighton and a woman in Dublin, and uncovers the truth once and for all. This is the story that's just about to begin . . .\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 152 x 241\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Ciara Geraghty\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780340998113\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 464\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45726763909273,"sku":"15RD-19780340998113","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68c9310c5db59_Lifesaving_for_Beginners_Ciara_Geraghty.jpg?v=1758089868","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/lifesaving-for-beginners","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}